ecord here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. On the middle in 2025, that same pair ran 28% of normal, while September to October hit 137%. In 2026, April to May came in at 112% on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 24738 had its driest year in 1988 at 58%.</p>"}
